    "terrace": {
      "note": "虹台 (native: 大会 A; guildhall.c: 每年的正月十七都要在水烟阁外的「虹台」推选武林盟主; wpath1.c 位于山巅的「虹台」, wpath4.c 竖立在虹台中央的「擎天柱」, wpath5.c 通过西边不远处的葬剑亭，就是虹台的入口……虹台地势虽不甚高，但是在三面深谷的环绕下，却自有一股群山朝拜的威严气象, swordtomb.c 往南便是直通虹台的石阶, wpath2.c 虹谷断崖): from 葬剑亭 a white stair climbs south along a narrow ridge, gorges both sides, onto the round white stone top of the peak: the 擎天柱 in its middle with an old bronze censer before it, nine stone flag seats in a ring round the rim (open north where the stair comes up; the hosts' seat south), the 盟主's stone chair inside the ring, its back to the south rim; west, a rough lip of rock over 虹谷, where the mist comes up out of the valley. Deep valleys on three sides. Empty but on the day: ways sized for the voxel view (DECISIONS「地图尺寸以体素视角为准」): the stair 128 px with its verges 192, the platform some 700 px across.",
